WEBVTT

00:06:58.309 --> 00:07:01.120
e me tha, "Oh, po shume mire,

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.493
vetem se me tingellon pak si femer."

00:07:03.493 --> 00:07:04.955
I thashe, "Cfare?"

00:07:04.955 --> 00:07:08.877
Ai tha, "Po, ti ke mesuar nga nje grua?"

00:07:08.877 --> 00:07:10.881
I thashe, " Po. Edhe?"

00:07:10.881 --> 00:07:13.522
Me pas ai me shpjegoi diferencat dhe vecorite ne ton

00:07:13.522 --> 00:07:15.772
mes zerit mashkullor e atij femeror

00:07:15.772 --> 00:07:19.574
dhe qe une e kisha mesuar mire,

00:07:19.574 --> 00:07:21.567
por me nje ze femre.

00:07:21.567 --> 00:07:23.790
(Te qeshura)

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:31.100
(Duartrokitje)